WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.583
How MarketLink works: pre-order from local farmers, pick up and pay at the market.

2
00:00:02.583 --> 00:00:08.333
Step 1: Find what you need. See which farmers are at the market this week, what they have and the price.

3
00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:14.083
Step 2: Pre-order in a few taps. Add fresh produce to your basket. There is no online payment.

4
00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:19.833
Step 3: Pick a pickup time. Choose a day and a time slot inside the market hours.

5
00:00:19.833 --> 00:00:25.583
Step 4: Collect and pay at the stall. We tell you when your order is packed. Pay the farmer in person.

6
00:00:25.583 --> 00:00:28.958
Fresh food, no wasted trips. Start shopping at your local farmers market.

